row(31, 2, 'MATERIAL', f'AVENGE THE VENGEANCE OF THE CHILDREN OF ISRAEL FROM THE MIDIANITES; AFTERWARD YOU SHALL BE GATHERED TO YOUR PEOPLE — THE DOUBLED ROOT\'S ONE SEAT, THE DEFINITE GENTILIC\'S TWO (THE COMMAND AND ITS RUN), THE DEATH SEQUENCED AFTER THE WAR. {HP(31, 2, (("נקם", "נקמת", "בני", "ישראל"), "AVENGE THE VENGEANCE of the children of Israel — the doubled root\'s one Bible seat; Israel\'s vengeance here, THE LORD\'S at 31:3 in Moses\' relay (computed); the Sifrei 157:1: the leaders\' praise — they do not depart until they take Israel\'s vengeance, which is His"), (("מאת", "המדינים"), "from THE MIDIANITES — the definite gentilic\'s TWO Bible seats: the command \'harass the Midianites\' (25:17) and this (computed) — the command and its run share the word; the Sifrei 157:1: Moab began (22:4, 7), yet Midian counseled — the two dogs and the wolf (Genesis 36:35 the old feud)"), (("אחר", "תאסף", "אל", "עמיך"), "AFTERWARD you shall be gathered to your people — one seat; the death promised at 27:13 (\'you shall be gathered to your people, you too, as Aaron your brother\') sequenced AFTER the war; the Sifrei 157:2: Moses\' death contingent on the war, and he went with zeal"))} → {AP(31, 2, (("אתפרע", "פרענות", "בני", "ישראל"), "take the retribution of the children of Israel"), (("מן", "מדינאי"), "from the Midianites"), (("בתר", "כן", "תתכנש", "לעמיך"), "after that you shall be gathered to your people"))}. No narrative verb.')
